WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:16.780
Benjamin held up Peter's handkerchief.

2
00:00:16.781 --> 00:00:21.473
"We can carry onions in this," said Benjamin.

3
00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:25.217
He put it on the ground.

4
00:00:25.218 --> 00:00:29.178
Benjamin went into an onion patch.

5
00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:35.559
He pulled up an onion. Shloomp!

6
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:41.767
"This is a nice one!" said Benjamin.

7
00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:45.061
He pulled up another onion.

8
00:00:45.062 --> 00:00:47.909
Peter looked around.

9
00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:51.228
His nose wiggled.

10
00:00:51.229 --> 00:00:58.090
Benjamin pulled up more onions.

11
00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:01.747
He rolled them onto the handkerchief.

12
00:01:01.748 --> 00:01:05.064
"Let's go," said Peter.

13
00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:10.228
"This garden isn't safe."

14
00:01:10.229 --> 00:01:14.146
"It's fine," said Benjamin.

15
00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:23.208
"I come here all the time with Father."

16
00:01:23.209 --> 00:01:26.586
He ate a lettuce leaf.

17
00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:33.869
"Mmm," said Benjamin. "Yummy!"

18
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:37.682
Benjamin walked deeper into the garden.

19
00:01:37.683 --> 00:01:43.840
Peter grabbed the handkerchief.

20
00:01:43.841 --> 00:01:54.538
He ran after his cousin.

21
00:01:54.539 --> 00:01:58.430
"What was that noise?" asked Peter.

22
00:01:58.431 --> 00:02:00.863
"Is the farmer coming?"

23
00:02:00.864 --> 00:02:04.582
"It's nothing," said Benjamin.

24
00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:08.372
Benjamin kept walking.

25
00:02:08.373 --> 00:02:14.150
Peter followed.

26
00:02:14.151 --> 00:02:20.151
They walked past flowerpots and garden tools.

27
00:02:20.152 --> 00:02:24.554
Suddenly Benjamin gasped.

28
00:02:24.555 --> 00:02:27.153
"I see a cat!"

29
00:02:27.154 --> 00:02:33.982
He and Peter slipped under a basket.

30
00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:40.211
They waited.

31
00:02:40.212 --> 00:02:48.323
Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff.

32
00:02:48.324 --> 00:02:51.397
The cat jumped onto the basket.

33
00:02:51.398 --> 00:02:59.736
Then she sat down.
